{"game": "risk-of-rain-returns", "language": "english", "appid": 1337520, "month": "2025-08", "window": 2, "start_date": 1754611200, "end_date": 1755302399, "month_true_total": 86, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 00:54:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "202150189", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079626654", "personaname": "Ssidereal", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198079626654/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 65, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 65, "last_played": 1752688533, "avatar": "599bc23eeb69a65b623b5d9cb2e13ad613f57757"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun game but no controller support", "timestamp_created": 1755220441, "timestamp_updated": 1755220441, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.291913241147994995", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202137907", "author": {"steamid": "76561198446355565", "personaname": "Wharles", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198446355565/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 613, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 426, "last_played": 1764732792, "avatar": "1c420d178f66d4691b32a82a49ec20a7825e74d9"}, "language": "english", "review": "very nice when enemies go boom :D", "timestamp_created": 1755205899, "timestamp_updated": 1755205899, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202029949", "author": {"steamid": "76561198064174111", "personaname": "arzgaa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198064174111/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 88, "playtime_forever": 351, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 351, "last_played": 1755071681, "avatar": "1b18c68920633deb7533906d18d010fe7a784fae"}, "language": "english", "review": "First of all, I was introduced to this series through Risk of Rain 2 which is among the games I've most enjoyed in the past few years. It's amazing. Hence it's no surprise I was interested in trying the classic when it was released as a remaster.\n\nBut. It's not RoR 2. Don't get me wrong. If the whole Risk of Rain thing works for you like a hailstorm of bullets in a flood of monsters, and you don't mind the \"downgrade\" to 2D-side scrolling and/or the pixel graphics (which, to me, are fine), and no aim other than left/right (which is a bit of a let down) you're likely to have a good time with this one as well. \n\nThe excitement I dove with into RoRR looking forward to unlock and play many familiar (and unfamiliar) survivors, items and environments and see how they are different in this dimension, soon passed and I couldn't help but yearn back to the brilliance of RoR 2. To me, it's so much better.\n\nAnd so, if you're looking to get into these games but you're unsure if you'll enjoy them, my recommendation goes to RoR 2. Then again, if you think it's likely you'll enjoy this one, you could start with this and then jump to RoR 2 once you're done with this one and want more and better. This is a solid game which originally (pre-remaster) started out the whole thing that RoR 2 owes it's excistence to. But for me, it's patting an itch that RoR 2's claws just scratch so much better.", "timestamp_created": 1755073281, "timestamp_updated": 1755079558, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52649003267288208", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201947635", "author": {"steamid": "76561198099976847", "personaname": "W Silvermane", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198099976847/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1456, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1339, "deck_playtime_at_review": 1339, "last_played": 1760464659, "avatar": "7f5a3028d0d58405af4ec84d003dcf6a5c4d91b2"}, "language": "english", "review": "I cant believe I have to call this game Abandon-ware AND NOW Spyware. My favorite game, Risk of Rain, is now another victim of Enshittification.\n\nTake Two and Gearbox can crawl back to hell.", "timestamp_created": 1754961240, "timestamp_updated": 1754961240, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 224, "votes_funny": 13, "weighted_vote_score": "0.601937949657440186", "comment_count": 19, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 28, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 19, "count": 8}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 5}, {"reaction_type": 17, "count": 2}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 2}, {"reaction_type": 8, "count": 2}, {"reaction_type": 16, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 7, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "201931237", "author": {"steamid": "76561197979535351", "personaname": "ItsMrJP", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/itsmrjp/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 2091, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2091, "deck_playtime_at_review": 977, "last_played": 1702599460, "avatar": "09e64aee9a10d9016021a0d315be5e1e0c3f2cbc"}, "language": "english", "review": "RIP Risk of Rain! It was fun while it lasted! \n\nTake-Two and 2K games have updated all their games Terms of Service, turning this game as well as all of their other games into literal spyware.", "timestamp_created": 1754940627, "timestamp_updated": 1754940627, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 68, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5872650146484375", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 3}, {"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}]}]}